; The program of observe_run_wait.tcalc under the rotating schedule.  The run is
; at (wait) twice, but not at the same configuration: the first step takes
; successor 0 of 2, (wait) again; the second takes successor 1 of 2 and wakes,
; and the run ends.  A state visited again is a cycle only when the pick does
; not depend on the turn.
(step one)
(observe run)
(schedule rotating)
(wait)
(rule stay (take (wait)) (make (wait)))
(rule wake (take (wait)) (make (wake)))
